OL,3,GNEWSAPolice patrols to raise awareness
OL,4,Aof drink spiking
OL,5,
OL,6,FExtra police patrols will take place
OL,7,Fduring Freshers' Week in Northampton.
OL,9,FNorthamptonshire Police said officers
OL,10,Fwould raise awareness of drink and drug
OL,11,Fspiking and personal safety.
OL,13,FPolice community support officers
OL,14,F(PCSOs) will offer crime prevention
OL,15,Fadvice and support alongside night-time
OL,16,Fpatrols to safeguard "those enjoying
OL,17,Fthe town's bars, pubs and clubs".
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
